        <mxCell id="YSfAUFXo6mKhQH8IgRp5-2" value="&lt;p&gt;RagaAI Catalyst is a comprehensive platform designed to enhance the management and optimization of LLM projects. It offers a wide range of features, including project management, dataset management, evaluation management, trace management, prompt management, synthetic data generation, and guardrail management. These functionalities enable you to efficiently evaluate, and safeguard your LLM applications.&lt;br&gt;RagaAI Catalyst 是一个全面的平台，旨在提升 LLM 项目的管理和优化。它提供了一系列功能，包括项目管理、数据集管理、评估管理、追踪管理、提示管理、合成数据生成和护栏管理。这些功能使您能够高效地评估和保护您的 LLM 应用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;https://github.com/raga-ai-hub/RagaAI-Catalyst.git&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3480" y="420" width="680" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
